{"4356780":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Screen Stocks","steam_appid":4356780,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h1>Join the Discord<\/h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4356780\/extras\/369a8c6eae3d56ffdb351a4a00c33d07.avif?t=1793095492\" width=780 height=200 \/><\/span><\/p><\/p><br><h1>About the Game<\/h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4356780\/extras\/f4ddb2bdfdb3509214ba87943c87ef4d.avif?t=1793095492\" width=780 height=350 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4356780\/extras\/b2cdececfe044281349766daacbf66a0.poster.avif?t=1793095492\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4356780\/extras\/b2cdececfe044281349766daacbf66a0.webm?t=1793095492\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4356780\/extras\/b2cdececfe044281349766daacbf66a0.mp4?t=1793095492\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRADE<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy, sell, short stocks online. In full screen or placed in the corner of your desktop while you take care of other things.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUY STOCKS<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various stocks are available for you to make your gains (or losses). Gain access to new stocks along the way and find those best suit your strategy.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy more stocks, receive more from dividends, increase your base income. Level up to gain bonuses such as auto-actions and higher offline returns.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer clicker stock trader<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up to unlock new stocks and abilities<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your income, dividends, and stock volume<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prestige by Going Public<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can be played in full screen or in the corner of your dekstop<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of skins<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4356780\/extras\/519db4c4e34f92013578347e40684ab3.poster.avif?t=1793095492\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4356780\/extras\/519db4c4e34f92013578347e40684ab3.webm?t=1793095492\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4356780\/extras\/519db4c4e34f92013578347e40684ab3.mp4?t=1793095492\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4356780\/extras\/f4ddb2bdfdb3509214ba87943c87ef4d.avif?t=1793095492\" width=780 height=350 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4356780\/extras\/b2cdececfe044281349766daacbf66a0.poster.avif?t=1793095492\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4356780\/extras\/b2cdececfe044281349766daacbf66a0.webm?t=1793095492\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4356780\/extras\/b2cdececfe044281349766daacbf66a0.mp4?t=1793095492\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRADE<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy, sell, short stocks online. In full screen or placed in the corner of your desktop while you take care of other things.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUY STOCKS<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various stocks are available for you to make your gains (or losses). Gain access to new stocks along the way and find those best suit your strategy.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy more stocks, receive more from dividends, increase your base income. Level up to gain bonuses such as auto-actions and higher offline returns.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer clicker stock trader<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up to unlock new stocks and abilities<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your income, dividends, and stock volume<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prestige by Going Public<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can be played in full screen or in the corner of your dekstop<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of skins<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4356780\/extras\/519db4c4e34f92013578347e40684ab3.poster.avif?t=1793095492\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/