ng system<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> MacOS 10.15 (Catalina)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 2.3 ghz dual-core intel core i5 or apple m1<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel iris plus graphics 640, amd radeon pro, or apple silicon gpu<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 150 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"legal_notice":"Screen Stocks 2026 © Conradical Sàrl"}}}